prietor, principal, partner, shareholder, agent, officer, director, board member, employee, joint venturer, independent contractor, promoter, member, director, manager, consultant, advisor, equity owner, lender, sales representative, or in any similar or other capacity, for any Competing Business in the Restricted Territory.","section":"","block":67,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-090951","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-18","reportDate":"2026-08-17","cik":"0001529113","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390026090951/ea030244201ex10-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/9e2a0d75954ddac05710d61633bfb97de7d7b87d4ee18becb7ca81d816a8b739.bin","sha256":"9e2a0d75954ddac05710d61633bfb97de7d7b87d4ee18becb7ca81d816a8b739"}},{"id":"c4331e761afa70c253404ec96885d5c7732b95f9366ddb487af6fd5aee992751","quote":"10. SUCCESSORS. The Company shall require any successor (whether direct or indirect, by Change of Control, purchase, merger, consolidation or otherwise) to all or substantially all of the business and/or assets of the Company, by agreement in form and substance reasonably satisfactory to the Executive, to expressly assume and agree to perform this Agreement in the same manner and to the same extent that the Company would be required to perform it if no such succession had taken place. Failure of the Company to obtain such an agreement prior to the effectiveness of any such succession shall be a material breach of this Agreement and shall entitle the Executive to compensation and all other benefits from the Company in the same amount and on the same terms as Executive would be entitled to hereunder if Executive terminated Executive’s employment for Sufficient Reason hereunder.","context":"9.4 Executive acknowledges and agrees that each and every restraint imposed by this Agreement is reasonable with respect to subject matter, duration, scope, and geogra